{{wp|portal=Grappling}}
[[File:USS Makin Island (LHD 8) 141111-M-HU038-049 (15592003009).jpg|thumb|Two [[marine#Noun|marines]] practicing grappling techniques during a {{w|United States Marine Corps}} Martial Arts Program]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|graple}} {{q|obsolete}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|grăpʹəl|a=RP,GA}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈɡɹæpəl/}}
* {{audio|en|en-ca-grapple.oga|a=CA}}
* {{audio|en|en-au-grapple.ogg|a=AU}}
* {{rhymes|en|æpəl|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|en|grap|ple}}

===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*gʰrebʰ-}}
From {{derived|en|enm|*grapplen||to seize, lay hold of}}, from {{derived|en|ang|*græpplian||to seize}} (compare {{cog|ang|ġegræppian||to seize}}), from {{derived|en|gem-pro|*graipilōną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*grabbalōną||to seize}}, from {{derived|en|ine-pro|*gʰrebʰ-|t=to take, seize, rake}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|grab|le}}.

Cognate with {{cog|nl|grabbelen||to grope, scramble, scrabble}}, {{cog|de|grabbeln||to rummage, grope about}} and {{m|de|grapsen}}, {{m|de|grapschen||to seize, grasp, grabble}}. Influenced in some senses by {{m|en|grapple||tool with claws or hooks|pos=noun}} (see below). See further at ''{{l|en|grasp}}''.

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[seize]] something and [[hold]] it [[firmly]].
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[wrestle]] or [[tussle]].
# {{lb|en|figuratively|with {{m|en|with}}}} To [[ponder]] and [[intensely]] [[evaluate]] a problem; to [[struggle]] to [[deal]] with.
#: {{ux|en|to '''grapple''' with one's conscience}}
#* {{quote-book|en|title=The Aging Brain|author=Timothy R. Jennings|year=2018|ISBN=9780801075223|page=173
|passage=Fear of death is a universal human concern with which all thinking people at some point '''grapple'''.}}
#* {{RQ:Guardian
|title=How our home delivery habit reshaped the world|author=Samanth Subramanian|date=November 21 2019|url=https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2019/nov/21/how-our-home-delivery-habit-reshaped-the-world
|passage=The frictionless appearance of a box on the doorstep is such a seductive notion. We have come to rely on it in such a brief period that we have not been able to '''grapple''' fully with the scale or the meaning of home delivery.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20261013090810/https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2019/nov/21/how-our-home-delivery-habit-reshaped-the-world|archivedate=13 October 2026}}

